    "title": "HD Camera for Android: 4K Cam",
    "description": "<b> HD Camera </b> is a Free and full featured beauty camera, with 4K Camera, professional capture mode, amazing Camera Filter and quick snap, you can easily take incredible HD selfie photos or HD videos on Android phones and tablets! \ud83d\udc8e \ud83c\udf07\r\nHD Camera also helps you easy to edit and crop pictures, make photo collage, cut HD videos. let's get ready to post the best selfie and short video to your social media account!\ud83c\udf03\ud83c\udf06\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 <b> Professional HD Camera </b>\r\n\u2713 Capture photos and videos in HD quality with superb camcorder\r\n\u2713 Intelligently Face Detection and auto-stabilize\r\n\u2713 Real-time Filter: Preview filter effect before taking pictures or shooting videos\r\n\u2713Camera Pro features: Scene modes, color effects, white balance, ISO, exposure compensation/lock.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf89 <b> Edit photo and video in Seconds </b>\r\n\u2713 Photo editor pro: adjust the brightness, contrast, vignette, fade, temperature, etc.\r\n\u2713 Collage Maker & Photo Grid: Select several pictures, easy to make a cool photo collage.\r\n\u2713 Trim and cut video never been so easy.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25 <b> More Features for HD Camera </b>:\r\n* Support for HDR, Quick Snap and Continuous shooting\r\n* HD Video recording and short video shooting\r\n* To turn off the optional shutter sound\r\n* Capture timer \r\n* Support changing the save path to an external sd memory card \r\n* Camera line, golden ration line\r\n* Location targeting feature,Optional GPS location tagging (geotagging) \r\n* Apply date and timestamp, location coordinates, and custom text to photos\r\n\r\nHD Camera is a fully featured free <b> 4K Camera </b> app, it\u2019s great for transforming everyday images into perfect, shareable photos.\ud83c\udf39\u2728",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b> HD Camera </b> is a Free and full featured beauty camera, with 4K Camera, professional capture mode, amazing Camera Filter and quick snap, you can easily take incredible HD selfie photos or HD videos on Android phones and tablets! \ud83d\udc8e \ud83c\udf07<br>HD Camera also helps you easy to edit and crop pictures, make photo collage, cut HD videos. let&#39;s get ready to post the best selfie and short video to your social media account!\ud83c\udf03\ud83c\udf06<br><br>\ud83c\udfa8 <b> Professional HD Camera </b><br>\u2713 Capture photos and videos in HD quality with superb camcorder<br>\u2713 Intelligently Face Detection and auto-stabilize<br>\u2713 Real-time Filter: Preview filter effect before taking pictures or shooting videos<br>\u2713Camera Pro features: Scene modes, color effects, white balance, ISO, exposure compensation/lock.<br><br>\ud83c\udf89 <b> Edit photo and video in Seconds </b><br>\u2713 Photo editor pro: adjust the brightness, contrast, vignette, fade, temperature, etc.<br>\u2713 Collage Maker &amp; Photo Grid: Select several pictures, easy to make a cool photo collage.<br>\u2713 Trim and cut video never been so easy.<br><br>\ud83d\udd25 <b> More Features for HD Camera </b>:<br>* Support for HDR, Quick Snap and Continuous shooting<br>* HD Video recording and short video shooting<br>* To turn off the optional shutter sound<br>* Capture timer <br>* Support changing the save path to an external sd memory card <br>* Camera line, golden ration line<br>* Location targeting feature,Optional GPS location tagging (geotagging) <br>* Apply date and timestamp, location coordinates, and custom text to photos<br><br>HD Camera is a fully featured free <b> 4K Camera </b> app, it\u2019s great for transforming everyday images into perfect, shareable photos.\ud83c\udf39\u2728",
